    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "1total = 100\n2\n3total += 10   # total = total + 10\n4print(total)\n5\n6# Output: 110"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, total += 10 adds 10 to the total variable."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Example 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "python",
      "content": "1x = 10\n2\n3x //= 4   # x = x // 4\n4print(x)\n5\n6# Output: 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Here, x //= 4 computes the quotient when x is divided by 4, and assigns the quotient to x."
    },
